				\begin{document}$$ \begin{array}{@{}rcl@{}} \text{NSP}_i &=& \frac{ \text{FN} + \text{TP} }{N}, \end{array} $$\end{document}NSPi=FN+TPN,3\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
				\usepackage{amsmath}
				\usepackage{wasysym} 
				\usepackage{amsfonts} 
				\usepackage{amssymb} 
