				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$ \begin{array}{@{}rcl@{}} m_{2}&:=&\text{effectiveness $\cdot$ (1 - cost)} = P_{R} \cdot (1 - P_{C}). \end{array} $$\end{document}m2:=effectiveness⋅(1 - cost)=PR⋅(1−PC).

