				\usepackage{amsbsy}
				\usepackage{mathrsfs}
				\usepackage{upgreek}
				\setlength{\oddsidemargin}{-69pt}
				\begin{document}$$  \mathrm{Type\ I\ error} = \frac{\text{FP}}{N - \text{NSP}_{i}}; $$\end{document}TypeIerror=FPN−NSPi;

and
